       return ((VESTING_PERIOD - timeSinceLastDistribution) * vestingAmount) / VESTING_PERIOD;

The issue is that each call to `transferInRewards()` resets the `lastDistributionTimestamp` to the current block timestamp. This resets the vesting period calculation.
