_owner = owner;
}

modifier onlyOwner() {
require(msg.sender == _owner, "Caller is not the owner");
_;
}
```

The `_owner` address is the only address that can deploy the contract. This ensures that only authorized addresses can deploy the contract, mitigating the risk of misuse.


